            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Embodiments of the present disclosure are directed to conserving energy of an injection device (102) that includes an energy source (104), an electronic component (105) configured to be electrically decoupled from the energy source (104), a priming component (112) configured to generate a trigger, and a mechanism (108, 109) attached to the priming component (112) and configured to perform operations comprising in response to receiving the trigger, electrically coupling the energy source (104) to the electronic component (105), as illustrated in FIGS. 1A- 1F.</p>
            </abstract>
